prd_sections[5]{pk,summary,title}:
  1,"Defines KAIROS channel memory consolidation behavior, truth ordering, and contradiction handling.",Overview and Scope
  2,"Describes background note-taking, consolidation outcomes, and chat-adjacent visibility constraints.",Goals and User-visible Behavior
  3,Specifies recency-first conflict handling with edge-informed validity and explicit contradiction links.,Truth and Contradiction Policy
