prd_rules[5]{pk,rule_name,section_pk,severity,summary}:
  1,kairos_php_first_consolidation,1,critical,"KAIROS consolidation is PHP-first with optional LLM assist, never model-only authority."
  2,contradictions_must_be_explicit,3,critical,Conflicting topic memories require explicit kairos_contradicts edge representation.
  3,recency_first_with_edge_override,3,high,Truth ordering prefers recency unless stronger validated evidence edges justify override.
  4,soft_delete_and_auditability,4,high,Memory consolidation actions must preserve lineage and avoid hard-delete semantics.
  5,temporal_no_backwards_reads,5,critical,Temporal discipline forbids backward-reading assumptions in consolidation state transitions.

